ile-height=\"196\" /></span></span></span>\n</p>\n</div><div>\n<div>\n<p>此作品在全世界都属于<b><a href=\"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%AC%E6%9C%89%E9%A2%86%E5%9F%9F\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:公有领域\">公有领域</a></b>，因为作者逝世已经超过100年，且作品于1931年1月1日之前出版。\n</p>\n</div>\n</div><div>\n<p><span class=\"noimageRight\"></span>\n</p>\n</div></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"licensetpl\">\n<p><span class=\"licensetpl&#95;short\">Public domain</span><span class=\"licensetpl&#95;long\">Public domain</span><span class=\"licensetpl&#95;link&#95;req\">false</span><span class=\"licensetpl&#95;attr&#95;req\">false</span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nParsed by mw‐web.codfw.main‐68d84f585c‐jc9zq\nCached time: 20260926115823\nCache expiry: 2592000\nCache expiry source: Template:PD‐old (currentyear)\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.090 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.103 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 399/1000000\nRevision size: 7292/2097152 bytes\nPost‐expand include size: 5527/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 975/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 7/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/500\nUnstrip recursion depth: 1/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 14348/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.035/10.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 3545523/52428800 bytes\nNumber of Wikibase entities loaded: 0/500\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   80.830      1 -total\n 39.55%   31.972      1 Template:PD-old\n 37.90%   30.631      1 Template:License\n 32.42%   26.206      5 Template:SKchar\n 13.70%   11.071      1 Template:SKQS_header\n  3.08%    2.487     18 Template:SK_anchor\n  1.29%    1.043      1 Template:SKQS_footer\n  1.28%    1.034      5 Template:SK_notes\n-->\n\n<!-- Render ID 92dca85d-b9a1-11f1-8ef7-67cff8e86594 -->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key zhwikisource:pcache:258879:|#|:idhash:canonical!zh and timestamp 20260926115823 and revision id 769231. Rendering was triggered because: page_v